Platinum Dreams changes to xwayland-satellite 0.8.3 (MPL-2.0), applied with patch -p1 --fuzz=0:
- Qt 6.12 compositor: xdg_wm_base from version 1; output names from xdg-output when wl_output is older than v4.
- Monitor-aware fullscreen (2026-10-20): a mapped window's ignored move request is remembered, and
  set_fullscreen names the output under the window's (requested) centre instead of None.
- Minimize (2026-10-22): WM_CHANGE_STATE IconicState (XIconifyWindow, e.g. Steam's minimize button)
  becomes xdg_toplevel.set_minimized; the desktop hides the application.

